# A Debian web host. Generic on purpose: these are interchangeable and
# short-lived, so they share one entry rather than each earning a file.
#
# No `hostname`, which means leave the machine's own name alone — the provider
# already gave it one that its DNS and its console agree on.
#
# No `profile`, which means no dotfiles: nothing here deploys a user
# environment.
capabilities: web-server, vps-hygiene
